    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_select_01",
      "hash64": "0E65523F48A7AD8E",
      "text": "Ich bin hier für einen Arenakampf!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_select_02",
      "hash64": "0E65513F48A7ABDB",
      "text": "Ich bin hier für einen Rap-Battle!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_08",
      "hash64": "1436A7F9B1C257CC",
      "text": "Du bist also nicht hier zum Rappen? Besser so, ♪\\nsonst machst du dich zum Deppen! ♪ Hahaha![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_09",
      "hash64": "1436A8F9B1C2597F",
      "text": "Haha! Netter Scherz, der geht mitten ins Herz! ♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_10",
      "hash64": "143A35F9B1C57EED",
      "text": "Was? Du findest, ich spreche komisch?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_11",
      "hash64": "143A34F9B1C57D3A",
      "text": "Das nennt sich Rappen!\\c\\nRap ist ein Spiel mit Reimen, Klängen und\\nGesängen. Quasi der Rhythmus deiner Seele![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_12",
      "hash64": "143A33F9B1C57B87",
      "text": "Zobiris bei Nacht steht Wacht und gibt acht! ♪\\nGanz allein, muss das sein? Nein, oh, nein! ♪\\c\\nSo geht das! Checkst du, was ich mein?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_13",
      "hash64": "143A32F9B1C579D4",
      "text": "Na ja, du bist ja auch [VAR 0x1100(00FF,110F,0000)]Pokémon-TrainerPokémon-Trainerin! Zeig mir\\nin einem Kampf, was du draufhast![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "110F",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_14",
      "hash64": "143A31F9B1C57821",
      "text": "Sonst spült mein Rap den Cash in die Kasse, ♪\\ndoch auch meine Geister-Pokémon sind erste ♪\\r\\nKlasse! ♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_15",
      "hash64": "143A30F9B1C5766E",
      "text": "Ich bin Etta, aka die Rapperin mit Rhythmus\\nin der Seele![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_16",
      "hash64": "143A2FF9B1C574BB",
      "text": "Fühlst du die Vibes, ist dein Geist so weit? ♪\\nMach dich bereit für meine Wenigkeit! ♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_17",
      "hash64": "143A2EF9B1C57308",
      "text": "Hahaha! Das war nice! Ich konnte die Vibes\\nzwischen dir und deine[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0101)]mn Pokémon richtig spüren.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
